      "source_signature": "theorem padicValNat_choose_prime_pow_add_index\n    {p n k : ℕ} (hp : p.Prime) (hkn : k ≤ p ^ n) (hk0 : k ≠ 0) :\n    padicValNat p (Nat.choose (p ^ n) k) + padicValNat p k = n",
