      "source_signature": "theorem prime_power_pow_dvd_choose_of_padicValNat_index\n    {p n k r : ℕ} (hp : p.Prime) (hkn : k ≤ p ^ n) (hk0 : k ≠ 0)\n    (hr : r + padicValNat p k ≤ n) :\n    p ^ r ∣ Nat.choose (p ^ n) k",
